Package: trafficmonitor-linux
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: TrafficMonitor for Linux contributors
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libqt6widgets6 (>= 6.5), libqt6sql6-sqlite, libqt6network6
Description: Always-on-top network, CPU, memory and GPU monitor
 TrafficMonitor for Linux is a Qt Widgets system monitor with a floating
 window, tray icon, SQLite history and a stable C ABI plugin system.
